r-radius: 50%; margin-right: 15px; object-fit: cover;\">\n        <div>\n            <p style=\"margin: 0; font-weight: bold; font-size: 16px;\">Joe Moulton</p>\n            <p style=\"margin: 2px 0 0 0; font-size: 14px; color: #666;\">Founder, FlowstateAI Automation</p>\n            <p style=\"margin: 2px 0 0 0; font-size: 13px;\"><a href=\"https://flowstateaiautomation.ai\" style=\"color: #3b82f6; text-decoration: none;\">flowstateaiautomation.ai</a></p>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</div>",
